{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_007_02_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0a01e1e69b2c8f3966b51f839965420d6f35e4188108cc492ddc8ec26f6dceec",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0550efe5a09dd75f577e1c94a94a60ac573e6be2462df92543a52e6e2d8a69ff",
      "text": "唔～嗯……难道就没有哔哔哔的灵感\n从天上掉下来喵～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6f3e2ec7e3179566edd309b6051305452c629d49e813dbc7482cca4ac43ed3f",
      "text": "飘飘然～……♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85ee1b7594f61c94c8dadafe1442d913547d7c53fa32fe9f9556a50ad817939d",
      "text": "唔……！？好像要收到什么电波了喵……\n动画、豆沙包、商人、偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7f2baafa51674ed24a5037a044a093df96d93afc956a78f6e95696dc5d1dfab",
      "text": "叮——！\n没错喵！偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c1d0120c1ee5311a87e0c9121e3bc1bf66590221093888e3b10900c060486aa",
      "text": "就以偶像为主题\n写新作落语喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d739c8361502259406f5f5b9331018a5e456c36789238b4b322573f95304cc1",
      "text": "既然决定了，\n那就马上开始研究偶像喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c29f31e9572f9185b80b4b162f2fe05d4860135eac4a09e4e16be1da9f621d8f",
      "text": "……喵喵？不过说到偶像，\n至今为止完全没有接触过喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f240cb1fbab771a18c2b2642b47eeb215178f317ea2d4c0ca2a653236b00886",
      "text": "果然，去听听歌或者看现场演唱会\n研究起来更快喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0d13ecb5546866f101a3e4569c9dd11b522f103656ea2e54bd4d059dc3ba343",
      "text": "总之，先去唱片店和书店，\n把偶像的资料统统买回来看看喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_007sai_02_1_1_007_02:1_1_007_02_g:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd7c253a790e5166e0df72b30f5f1a30f8be5bb9970a6a7412c7fdd070ad1fa",
      "text": "猫君！那么吾辈\n就先走一步喵！喵呼呼～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
